      "content_markdown": "**উদাহরণ ৬.** আড়গুণন পদ্ধতিতে সমাধান কর:\n$$\\frac{x}{2} + \\frac{y}{3} = 8$$\n$$\\frac{5x}{4} - 3y = -3$$\n\n**সমাধান:** প্রদত্ত সমীকরণদ্বয়কে $ax + by + c = 0$ আকারে সাজিয়ে পাই,\n\n$$\\frac{x}{2} + \\frac{y}{3} = 8$$\n$$\\text{বা, } \\frac{3x + 2y}{6} = 8$$\n$$\\text{বা, } 3x + 2y - 48 = 0$$\n\n$$\\text{আবার, } \\frac{5x}{4} - 3y = -3$$\n$$\\text{বা, } \\frac{5x - 12y}{4} = -3$$\n$$\\text{বা, } 5x - 12y + 12 = 0$$\n\n$$\\therefore \\text{ সমীকরণদ্বয়}$$\n$$3x + 2y - 48 = 0$$\n$$5x - 12y + 12 = 0$$\n\nআড়গুণন পদ্ধতিতে পাই,\n$$\\frac{x}{2 \\times 12 - (-12) \\times (-48)} = \\frac{y}{(-48) \\times 5 - 12 \\times 3} = \\frac{1}{3 \\times (-12) - 5 \\times 2}$$\n$$\\text{বা, } \\frac{x}{24 - 576} = \\frac{y}{-240 - 36} = \\frac{1}{-36 - 10}$$\n$$\\text{বা, } \\frac{x}{-552} = \\frac{y}{-276} = \\frac{1}{-46}$$",
